      "content": "thanks. that's a good start and definitely accurate, but it's actually a bit too short for the system to rank it highly in the library. the current length is only giving it a very low score.\n\ncan you expand on this? i need you to go much deeper into the mathematical derivation and the implications for wavefunctions/operators. please try to make it a really substantial piece of writing so it actually gets enough \"depth\" to rank well, but again, please keep it meaningful. don't just repeat yourself, just give me more actual content and technical detail. thanks.",
